      url: "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Konrad_Knopp"
    - title: "Abel-Dini-Pringsheim theorem (Wikipedia)"
      url: "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abel%E2%80%93Dini%E2%80%93Pringsheim_theorem"
