research/audit/wave7-dispatch/certifier-a6-repair-fs-nth-term-test-converse-final.log:7334:research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-refuter-cor-ratio-test-is-kummer-with-constant-weights.prompt.md:1417:- **This is a necessary condition and never a sufficient one.** It rules a series out; it never rules one in. The harmonic series has terms tending to $0$ and diverges, which is exactly the content of [[fs-nth-term-test-converse]].
