research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log:734670:+### 2. `ex-abel-dini-pair-for-the-harmonic-series`: false last-divergent claim
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-734671-+
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-734672-+Class: **(a) unambiguous falsehood**.
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-734673-+
