research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-743512-+standard convergence-test statement instead use an error
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-743513-+$O(k^{-\beta})$ for some $\beta>1$.
