research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-770020-+> The absence of a slowest divergent positive series comes from applying
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log:770021:+> Abel–Dini again to the newly produced divergent series, not from a
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-770022-+> last-exponent claim about this fixed pair.
