research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-770058-+  `def-limsup-liminf`, but no numbered step cites L2. Add `L2` to step 1.3,
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-770059-+  where the limit superior is used as the infimum of the tail suprema.
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log:770060:+- `ex-harmonic-series-diverges` Fact L8 identifies the example as the $p=1$
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-770061-+  case of the p-series theorem, while the item expressly says neither proof
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-770062-+  uses that theorem. Delete the unused L8 paragraph. The same identification
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-770063-+  remains, correctly cited, in the Example prose.
