research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-778907-+  uses that theorem. Delete the unused L8 paragraph. The same identification
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-778908-+  remains, correctly cited, in the Example prose.
